योगयुक्तो मुनिर्ब्रह्म न चिरेणाधिगच्छति ॥ ६ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":1593,\"bb\":1411,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/5/6/b1411/\",\"body_value\":\"sannyāsas tu mahā-bāho
duḥkham āptum ayogataḥ
