na cireṇādhigacchati\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":1594,\"bb\":1412,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/5/6/b1412/\",\"shadow_value\":\"sannyāsaḥ – the renounced order of life; tu – but; mahā-bāho – O mighty-armed one; duḥkham – distress; āptum – afflicts one with; ayogataḥ – without devotional service; yoga-yuktaḥ – one engaged in devotional service; muniḥ – a thinker; brahma – the Supreme; na cireṇa – without delay; adhigacchati – attains.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"sannyāsaḥ\",\"translation\":\"the renounced order of life\"},{\"word\":\"tu\",\"translation\":\"but\"},{\"word\":\"mahā-bāho\",\"translation\":\"O mighty-armed one\"},{\"word\":\"duḥkham\",\"translation\":\"distress\"},{\"word\":\"āptum\",\"translation\":\"afflicts one with\"},{\"word\":\"ayogataḥ\",\"translation\":\"without devotional service\"},{\"word\":\"yoga-yuktaḥ\",\"translation\":\"one engaged in devotional service\"},{\"word\":\"muniḥ\",\"translation\":\"a thinker\"},{\"word\":\"brahma\",\"translation\":\"the Supreme\"},{\"word\":\"na cireṇa\",\"translation\":\"without delay\"},{\"word\":\"adhigacchati\",\"translation\":\"attains\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":1595,\"bb\":1413,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/5/6/b1413/\",\"body_value\":\"Merely renouncing all activities yet not engaging in the devotional service of the Lord cannot make one happy. But a thoughtful person engaged in devotional service can achieve the Supreme without delay.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":1596,\"bb\":1414,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/5/6/b1414/\",\"body_value\":\"$25\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 5.6\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 5.6\"},\"locale